# SPDX-License-Identifier: GPL-3.0-or-later
# The theme (Sam, 2026-11-12: comparing palettes on the FM-1 without a flash each): Settings (GLO), SELECT or ALGO
# steps through base's palettes at once, PLUM+ by default; the device keeps the choice through a reboot, the splash in
# it. A change while a song plays is kept only once all is silent, as the home is (a flash save stalls the audio).
listen
wait 1400
expect theme 9
tap GLO
wait 50
said SETTINGS. THEME PLUM+
shot theme-settings.png
spin SELECT -1
wait 50
said THEME PLUM
expect theme 8
spin ALGO 2
wait 50
said THEME OXBLOOD
expect theme 10
wait 100
expect theme_kept 1
reboot
expect splash 1
expect theme 10
wait 100
shot theme-splash.png
wait 1400
expect theme 10
tap PLAY
wait 3000
tap GLO
spin SELECT 1
wait 50
said THEME OXBLOOD+
wait 2000
expect theme_kept 0
tap PLAY
wait 2000
expect theme_kept 1
reboot
wait 1400
expect theme 11
tap GLO
spin SELECT -2
wait 50
expect theme 9
